+# Aegis Actionable Hardening Checklist
+
+This checklist groups the scripts and steps added in the patch into an operator-friendly sequence.
+
+1) Runtime isolation
+ - Run: ops/cluster/runtime_isolation_check.sh
+ - Use ops/cluster/runtime_validator_enhanced.py for JSON reports and S3 upload
+ - Install chosen runtime (runsc | kata | firecracker) on nodes, label nodes: runtime.aegis/has-isolation=true
+ - Deploy webhook with TLS & cosign config: deploy/webhook/deployment-cosign.yaml and update ValidatingWebhookConfiguration with CA
+
+2) xFormers
+ - Build wheels on representative GPU host:
+     ops/xformers/build_wheels_gpu.sh /output/dir cu118 torch2.2
+ - Upload wheels to S3 and set XFORMERS_S3_PREFIX
+ - Rebuild worker image (services/serving/diffusers/Dockerfile.worker.pinned) and verify on a GPU node:
+     python ops/xformers/verify_xformers_on_node.py
+
+3) Watermarking
+ - Configure vendor (WATERMARK_VENDOR_MODE) and install vetted vendor package
+ - Run large-scale validation:
+     services/serving/diffusers/watermark/adv_validation_runner.py
+ - Produce forensic bundles with services/serving/diffusers/forensic_reporter.py and sign with cosign (KMS)
+
+4) Moderation
+ - Calibrate thresholds:
+     services/serving/diffusers/moderation/calibrate_and_deploy.py --dataset labeled.jsonl --out thresholds.json --cm thresholds-cm.yaml
+ - Apply ConfigMap thresholds to moderation service and ensure reviewer deployment/HPA online
+ - Ensure reviewer staffing and SLA monitoring (use moderation_reassign.py for stale items)
+
+5) Carbon awareness
+ - Ensure dcgm-exporter is scraped by Prometheus (deploy/monitoring/dcgm-exporter-deploy.yaml)
+ - Instrument jobs using services/serving/diffusers/worker_instrumentation.start_meter/stop_meter
+ - Use ops/monitoring/energy_accountant.py and services/telemetry/carbon_lookup.py to compute energy & CO2
+ - Use ops/monitoring/carbon_node_scheduler.py to select low-carbon nodes for batch jobs
+
+6) Quantum
+ - PoC only: services/quantum/* provide simulator and provider adapter stubs
+ - To productionize: implement provider adapters, credentials, quotas, and evidence capture
+
+7) Self-heal
+ - Use ops/self_heal/gitops_rollback.py to create PRs for safe, operator-reviewed rollbacks
+ - Integrate a guard/approval step before automated rollbacks are applied
+
+Notes:
+ - Replace placeholder values (secrets, image names, S3 buckets) before applying manifests.
+ - Many actions require cluster admin privileges and/or vendor credentials (cosign KMS, carbon API).
+
